  "product": {
    "id": 7588559061246,
    "title": "(AMZN-NLN) SoundPEATS T2 Wireless Earbuds ANC Noise Cancelling Bluetooth V5.1 Earphones Transparency Mode With 12mm Large Dynamic Driver",
    "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong><span>\u00a0</span><span>As our store also sell on amazon, we do receive returns from the customers by stating reason as \"No longer needed\" called as AMZN-NLN. The products sold in this collection are UNUSED, in almost new - 100% working condition. So, here is an opportunity for our customers to experience the best at deeply discounted prices :)</span></strong></span><strong></strong>\u00a0</p>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<h3><br></h3>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">What make it stand out ?</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">1.Hybrid Active Noise Reduction,Combined with feedforward and feedback ANC technology, T2 can reduce ambient noise by up to 30dB.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">2.12mm large dynamic driver,The ultimate music provided to you.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">12mm large dynamic driver and advanced audio processing technology, T2 delivers incredibly high-quality sound and deep bass with rich details, two mics with each earbud can ensure crystal-clear calls.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">3.The latest bluetooth 5.1 technology can provide fast and stable connection.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">4.T2 can be used for 10 hours per single charge.The compact charging case provides up to 30 hours battery life.</span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Model Number: </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">T2</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Chipset: </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">AB1562A</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Total Standby Time: </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">30h</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Waterproof Standard:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"> IPX-5</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Active Noise-Cancellation:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"> Yes</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Bluetooth Version:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"> Bluetooth V5.1</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Earphones battery capacity:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"> 55mAh* 2</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Charging case battery capacity:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"> 370mAh</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Supported Bluetooth Profiles:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"> AVRCP A2DP HFP</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Supported Bluetooth Codec: </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">SBC AAC MP3</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Earphone size:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"> 21.7 * 17.6*27.74mm</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Charging case:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\"> 64.8*28.7*41.7mm</span></p>\n<p><br> <strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">Packaging Details:</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">1x Wireless Earbuds</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">1 x Charging Cable</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">1 x Charging Case</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">2 extra pairs Ear Tips</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;\">1 x User Manual</span><img alt=\"Soundpeats t2 wireless earbuds anc noise cancelling bluetooth v5.1 earphones transparency mode with 12mm large dynamic driver\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H644b0b2a92344a08a54e75a82b9eaf92c.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"Soundpeats t2 wireless earbuds anc noise cancelling bluetooth v5.1 earphones transparency mode with 12mm large dynamic driver\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H4bd816a3bb124f6d9b51e8a7e50097c3G.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"Soundpeats t2 wireless earbuds anc noise cancelling bluetooth v5.1 earphones transparency mode with 12mm large dynamic driver\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H614405eb48474f36a815729f38eb4b35H.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"Soundpeats t2 wireless earbuds anc noise cancelling bluetooth v5.1 earphones transparency mode with 12mm large dynamic driver\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H6493558f1ebe495e95b4b2cd69909dc4Z.jpg\" slate-data-type=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"><img alt=\"Soundpeats t2 wireless earbuds anc noise cancelling bluetooth v5.1 earphones transparency mode with 12mm large dynamic driver\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Ha6264b60a25040e69